#: lib/components/settings/instance/config/instance_config_live.sface:117
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid ""
"Enables stricter enforcement of users' boundaries and blocks, as well as "
"instance-wide blocks. Please note that this may reduce performance, reach, "
"and/or compatibility with some federated apps, and does not fully prevent "
"public posts and profiles from being fetched by third parties. Except public"
" profiles: other servers can still look up public groups and people without "
"signing in, so servers that don't sign their requests can find them and "
"receive their posts, but everything else needs authentication. Everything: "
"servers that don't sign their requests (eg. Lemmy before version 1.0) can't "
"reach this instance at all."
msgstr ""
"Zorgt voor strengere handhaving van de begrenzing en blokkeringen van "
"gebruikers en van blokkeringen voor de hele server. Let op: dit kan de "
"snelheid, het bereik en/of de samenwerking met sommige gefedereerde apps "
"verminderen. Het voorkomt ook niet helemaal dat derden openbare berichten en"
" profielen ophalen. Behalve openbare profielen: andere servers kunnen "
"openbare groepen en mensen nog steeds opzoeken zonder in te loggen. Servers "
"die hun verzoeken niet ondertekenen, kunnen ze dus vinden en hun berichten "
